{
 "description": "ChainHelix Verified, the live map of agents on BNB Smart Chain that are actually running: every ERC-8004 registration is probed from its own on-chain record and only alive and hireable agents are listed, each with its endpoint, skills, probe age in seconds, latency, and the permanent evidence record on BNB Greenfield. Many registrations can point at one endpoint: distinctEndpoints counts the endpoints and endpointShared marks the shared ones. Optional status hireable or alive. Price: 2 cents per call.",
